    "Training depth moments pool actual augmented training forwards over the epoch and are draw-weighted; they cannot be equated to checkpoint clean-eval whole geometry.",
    "A per-epoch inactive ID is recovered from a saved zero span containing the epoch; its future return means at least one later saved hard selection.",
    "The e5 histogram independently normalizes whole, all-proxy, sample-selected and sample-inactive densities; curve height does not reflect population counts."
